nd strange's reply subtly implies  the level to which he is mastering his  new duties  i have to tell you he was adamant that  he not be disturbed your father said he  had chosen to remain in exile  in just a few sentences strange reveals  that he had dared to confront the old  father when he arrived on earth and that  their meeting was enough for strange to  earn odin's respect and confidence the  king of the gods trusted strange alone  with the secret a secret strange keeps  until the next king thor has need of it  after thorin his revenges defeat heller  on asgard thanos's ship sanctuary 2  ambushes the survivors as his last act  before being killed by thanos's black  order heimdall sends bruce banner to  earth specifically to the residents of  doctor strange banner warns strange of  thanos imminent rival on earth and thus  the infinity war begins strange is a key  player throughout accompanying iron man  and spider-man as they travel to  confront thanos on titan after joining  up with the guardians of the galaxy the  trio battles thanos who is by then in  possession of four of the infinity  stones strange plays perhaps the biggest  role in the fight not just an opposing  thanos but also in scanning alternate  futures to determine the single course  of events that will lead to the mad  titan's defeat at the end of this  confrontation strange gives up the time  stone to thanos a choice only he knows  is right  tony  there was no other way  the war against thanos ends with a blip  an event in which half of all life  disappears in a matter of moments in  several films and tv shows characters  explicitly state that the blip lasted 5  years as thanos blipped strange he spent  2018 to 2023 simply not existing those  who have blipped didn't notice the  passage of time at all and so to strange  one moment it was 2018 and the next it  was 2023 drawing strange's five-year  absence the remaining population of the  universe carried on and a few notable  events took place two